 "meta": {
  "title": "A limited van: does the forecast's spread help choose the docks?",
  "caption": "Each morning one van can make at most this many stops across the 80 docks. Each policy ranks the docks by what it thinks a visit would save, visits the top ones and is scored on what happened. Pounds are per morning across all 80 docks; doing nothing costs about 460 a morning. 'Van already paid for' means a stop costs only the handling, 0.4 a bike. Nine folds only.",
